--------------------

Layered Architecture View
+--------------------------------------------------+
|                  Presentation Layer              |
|        (Browser, Wallet, User Interaction)       |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|                  Application Layer               |
|        (Frontend Logic, State Management)         |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|                  Service Layer                   |
|        (Backend, IPFS Pinning, Validation)        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|                  Storage Layer                   |
|     IPFS (Files) + Ethereum (Metadata Only)      |
+--------------------------------------------------+



